{
  "id": "classroom-help",
  "title": "課堂借物與求助",
  "titleEn": "Borrowing a Pencil in Class",
  "category": "校園與學習",
  "level": "入門",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/classroom-help.webp",
    "alt": "在陽光明亮的教室裡，小男孩坐在書桌前向鄰座的女同學借鉛筆，女同學面帶微笑親切地遞給他鉛筆，講臺前的老師溫柔地微笑注視著他們。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo looks at his "
        },
        {
          "text": "desk",
          "wordIds": [
            "desk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", but he only has an "
        },
        {
          "text": "eraser",
          "wordIds": [
            "eraser"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and a "
        },
        {
          "text": "ruler",
          "wordIds": [
            "ruler"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 看著書桌，但他只有一個橡皮擦和一把尺。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "999e3b72da16fc30eb68cb74aee89684656ace0b0a10017876e37c489557e45e",
        "sha256": "2d22bd75a1c128c7d45b4f314ac99cd95eb6d163f13bf5d1a33b0d9e449eb8da"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He forgot his "
        },
        {
          "text": "pencil",
          "wordIds": [
            "pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and turns to his "
        },
        {
          "text": "classmate",
          "wordIds": [
            "classmate"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mia for help."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他忘了帶鉛筆，便轉向同學 Mia 求助。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c0ff52409af4a1c994ad0dd08d301280a1db731fd704d113571cb1d358ae3f53",
        "sha256": "085c7786a29b05924995dec8cf6573888904fbb47bff31cceb44799ce0d82d39"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo asks politely, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can I borrow a ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-borrow-a-pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pencil",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-borrow-a-pencil"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-borrow-a-pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 有禮貌地問：「我可以借一枝鉛筆嗎？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7ba91604e3c95ed2e917ef18d128dc453c6c8b88471b835baaa045090d91797d",
        "sha256": "29e7d3d0b8aeeec8f56111312c169d6e5ee2534b61b818949a44cc8d3cb7b9ed"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia smiles warmly and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here you are.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "here-you-are"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 親切地微笑著說：「這給你。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "d22628f753d2f4f6d3e39b93df80991e4925471e505a45ed96a357cf047a073e",
        "sha256": "d7608f06d9e80f05071224b202ba39e6b56b7cd789f1fe0de9b3b31fd97c372a"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo takes the "
        },
        {
          "text": "pencil",
          "wordIds": [
            "pencil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you very much.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thank-you-very-much"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 接過鉛筆並說：「非常謝謝你。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "3efcf3526f04a21fba5d2601868b914b36a68f0954da40bb1131b0976e562372",
        "sha256": "3f261f4b9c5342e03c2e3f79075d885fb16b85a045f955c5dcec4bfd9ddf23d3"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mia answers with a friendly smile, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're welcome.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "youre-welcome"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Mia 帶著友善的微笑回答：「不客氣。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "fd8572bdd543c2961fe3a26f7ae9275f32d7a4f27d0d821db56a40b052d6eacb",
        "sha256": "76bf9740cba34546e85f88e7e7de545c60caa7640011a239dd661b1b8e6a32ac"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Their "
        },
        {
          "text": "teacher",
          "wordIds": [
            "teacher"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " smiles at them and starts the lesson."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們的老師對著他們微笑，並開始上課。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/classroom-help/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c431a88b106edc4a5560ddda3d38d7b37ccc61b4ba16f251bfb29ef79d3b6410",
        "sha256": "96e4557b917adb6457bb22f5825231ce554932487834c0dbe53b45feb4225c99"
      }
    }
  ],
